**/*.tsbuildinfo
# A host virtualenv holds binaries for the wrong platform; the image builds
# its own with uv sync. The ** prefix matters — a bare `.venv/` would only
# match the context root, not swellkit/.venv.
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
.git/
